hrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (standard provability formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (standard-provability-formula predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> (computably-enumerable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (Löb-property predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\nT\\vdash_R\\bigl(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\to T\\vdash_R\\varphi\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\n\\land\\mathrm{EffRule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}},g}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(g[T])\n\\land Q\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\n\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\left[\nT\\vdash_R\\bigl(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\to T\\vdash_R\\varphi\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span> : 标准对象语言可证性公式 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"254200a991dbb642\" href=\"?note=254200a991dbb642\" title=\"88-df-provability-predicate\">88-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T,R,g,\\Pr}(\\varphi)\\)</span>注册 Löb 蕴含；性质对所有合格参数成立由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"31607a9fe3d8287b\" href=\"?note=31607a9fe3d8287b\" title=\"88-thm-lob\">88-thm-lob</a>断言。</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>证明&quot;若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>Löb定理回答了Henkin问题：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\varphi\\)</span>何时可证？</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi